  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"82\" src=\"assets\\st0082_37cece7afc82.jpg\" width=\"300\" /><br /><br />Extra stability is gained when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is reduced to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> and is thus an oxidizing agent.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"69\" src=\"assets\\st0082_f831d8945987.jpg\" width=\"430\" />"
